  {
    num: "4080"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Tempeh Stir Fry\"\n  servings: 8\n  prep_time: \"56 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"54 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 tbsp fish stock\"\n    \"2 tbsp macadamia nut\"\n    \"2 tsp haloumi\"\n    \"2 pieces elderberry\"\n    \"2 cups asparagus\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"An exquisite rhubarb dish, paired with bacon and a hint of sweet basil.\"\n    \"An exquisite venison roast, infused with the essence of pineapple, slow-roasted to bring out its natural flavors and served with a side of creamy bok choy\"\n    \"Fresh mixed greens tossed with green cardamom-rubbed kangaroo, eggplant, and a light dressing.\"\n    \"Tender lamb skewers, glazed with a sweet and tangy apple sauce, served over a bed of fragrant jasmine rice.\"\n    \"A slow-roasted Mourning Warbler with a crispy, golden exterior. Stuffed with watermelon and covered in lemon sauce. Sides with pumpkin puree and wild dried chinese broccoli.\"\n    \"A special salmon quince from Kyrgyz Republic. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of korma.\"\n    \"Baked ricemilk-stuffed duck, seasoned with korma and spicy herbs, accompanied by roasted green pepper medley.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 398\n    protein: \"11g\"\n    carbs: \"39g\"\n    fat: \"25g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
