    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Bruschette With Tomato\"\n  servings: 7\n  prep_time: \"57 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"93 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 tsp jarrahdale pumpkin\"\n    \"1 pieces poppy seed\"\n    \"3 tsp quark\"\n    \"1 tbsp mastic\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A heartwarming Kurdish soup, featuring fresh file powder and an aromatic blend of traditional spices.\"\n    \"Baked chicken-stuffed beef, seasoned with french lavender and sweet herbs, accompanied by roasted carob carrot medley.\"\n    \"Tenderly braised turkey in a rich thyme and okra sauce, served with a side of creamy chilli pepper.\"\n    \"A simple blackberry pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n    \"Three quark with purple carrot, capers, bok choy, carrot and amaranth. With a side of baked cranberry, and your choice of crabs or pasta.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 541\n    protein: \"15g\"\n    carbs: \"92g\"\n    fat: \"5g\"\n  }\n}"
