  {
    num: "4480"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Salmon With Peach Sauce\"\n  servings: 7\n  prep_time: \"49 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"118 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"1 tbsp prunes\"\n    \"2 cups freekeh\"\n    \"1 pieces corn tortilla\"\n    \"3 lbs pecorino\"\n    \"2 oz corn syrup\"\n    \"3 tsp kale\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Three goji berry with chinese cabbage, beans, carob carrot, asian greens and starfruit. With a side of baked grape, and your choice of almonds or oats.\"\n    \"A bitter pumpkin creation, seasoned with onion seed and chilli pepper, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n    \"Hearty tamarillo and kangaroo stew, slow-cooked with saffron and hijiki for a comforting, flavorful meal.\"\n    \"Tenderly braised kangaroo in a rich dill and green pepper sauce, served with a side of creamy garlic.\"\n    \"A delightful tart combining golden cos lettuce and sweet cantaloupe, set in a buttery pastry shell and finished with a hint of sumac.\"\n    \"A classic pie filled with delicious chicken and tender pecan nut, baked in a zesty pastry crust and topped with a golden-brown lattice.\"\n    \"A delightful tart combining sweet bean shoots and sweet avocado, set in a buttery pastry shell and finished with a hint of korma.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 532\n    protein: \"8g\"\n    carbs: \"85g\"\n    fat: \"24g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "4481"
    title: "Git Hooks"
    description: "Git hook scripts for pre-commit and pre-push."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "# Git hooks configuration\n{\n  # Runs before each commit\n  pre-commit: \"\"\"\n#!/bin/sh\nset -e\n\n# Run linter\nnpx eslint --fix .\n\n# Run type check\nnpx tsc --noEmit\n\n# Stage fixed files\ngit add -u\n\"\"\"\n\n  # Runs before push to remote\n  pre-push: \"\"\"\n#!/bin/sh\nset -e\n\n# Run full test suite\nnpm test\n\n# Check for console.log\nif grep -rn \"console\\.log\" src/; then\n  echo \"Error: console.log found\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\"\"\"\n\n  # Validate commit message format\n  commit-msg: \"\"\"\n#!/bin/sh\n# Enforce conventional commit format\nif ! head -1 \"$1\" | grep -qE \"^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|test|chore)(\\(.+\\))?: .+\"; then\n  echo \"Error: Invalid commit message format\"\n  echo \"Use: type(scope): description\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\"\"\"\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "4482"
    title: "Makefile Targets"
    description: "Build targets with embedded shell commands."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "# Build targets\n{\n  project: \"cellar\"\n  default: \"build\"\n  targets: {\n    # Build the application\n    build: {\n      deps: [\n        \"clean\"\n        \"lint\"\n      ]\n      script: \"\"\"\necho \"Building...\"\ngo build -o bin/app ./cmd/app\necho \"Build complete\"\n\"\"\"\n    }\n\n    # Run tests with coverage\n    test: {\n      script: \"\"\"\necho \"Running tests...\"\ngo test -v -race -coverprofile=coverage.out ./...\ngo tool cover -html=coverage.out -o coverage.html\n\"\"\"\n    }\n\n    clean: {\n      script: \"\"\"\nrm -rf bin/ dist/ coverage.out coverage.html\necho \"Cleaned\"\n\"\"\"\n    }\n\n    # Docker build and push\n    docker: {\n      deps: [\n        \"build\"\n      ]\n      script: \"\"\"\ndocker build -t nucleotidase:latest .\ndocker push galoshes:latest\n\"\"\"\n    }\n  }\n}"
  }
