  {
    num: "4868"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Cherry-infused Chicken Roast\"\n  servings: 7\n  prep_time: \"31 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"91 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"3 tbsp fenugreek\"\n    \"1 oz radicchio\"\n    \"1 cups cardamom\"\n    \"4 pieces french eschallots\"\n    \"4 tsp garlic\"\n    \"2 oz flaxseed oil\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A simple elderberry pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n    \"Tender quail skewers, glazed with a sweet and tangy feijoa sauce, served over a bed of fragrant jasmine rice.\"\n    \"A classic pie filled with delicious crocodile and delicious oyster mushrooms, baked in a sweet pastry crust and topped with a golden-brown lattice.\"\n    \"Three cloves with squash, chilli pepper, pumpkin, cauliflower and shark. With a side of baked nectarine, and your choice of cottage cheese or scallops.\"\n    \"A slow-roasted Sage Thrasher with a zesty, delicious exterior. Stuffed with aubergine and covered in pear sauce. Sides with swiss chard puree and wild peppers.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 397\n    protein: \"36g\"\n    carbs: \"83g\"\n    fat: \"27g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
