    description: "A blog post with metadata and content sections."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Advenio adulatio vicinus uter brevis adfectus contego.\"\n  slug: \"arbor-videlicet-valeo\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Ivah Nienow\"\n    avatar: \"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28387407\"\n    bio: \"completion lover, blogger\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-05-06\"\n  tags: [\n    \"accompanist\"\n    \"term\"\n    \"tooth\"\n  ]\n\n  published: false\n  reading_time: \"9 min\"\n  summary: \"Arcesso venustas sumptus turba vicissitudo. Viscus terror baiulus administratio vulticulus reprehenderit alioqui tutamen. Ustulo tabernus a depopulo statua ipsa tabula cubitum.\"\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "4971"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Pork Belly Buns\"\n  servings: 7\n  prep_time: \"36 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"88 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"2 oz sesame oil\"\n    \"1 lbs curry leaves\"\n    \"1 cups peppermint\"\n    \"2 oz white wine vinegar\"\n    \"1 lbs sausages\"\n    \"3 cups swordfish\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Juicy crocodile, grilled to your liking and drizzled with a bold aniseed sauce, served alongside roasted radish.\"\n    \"A slow-roasted Clark's Nutcracker with a tender, moist exterior. Stuffed with elderberry and covered in corella pear sauce. Sides with kale puree and wild english spinach.\"\n    \"An exquisite capers dish, paired with nuts and a hint of five spice.\"\n    \"An exquisite duck roast, infused with the essence of mulberry, slow-roasted to bring out its natural flavors and served with a side of creamy cabbage\"\n    \"Tenderly braised chicken in a rich chervil and bean sprouts sauce, served with a side of creamy kohlrabi.\"\n    \"A classic pie filled with delicious kangaroo and sour jicama, baked in a savory pastry crust and topped with a golden-brown lattice.\"\n    \"Our creamy goose, slow-cooked to perfection, accompanied by steamed bean sprouts and a rich, savory gravy.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 592\n    protein: \"27g\"\n    carbs: \"44g\"\n    fat: \"18g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
